        "id": 1947190
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-26T11:13:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On my opinion, I don\u0027t think breaking the `ETSI EN 300 468 V1.17.1` definition is a good idea. I prefer keeping these two attributes as-is.\nAnother way to solve this is introducing another structure to store `audioPreselections` and `ac4ShortProgramId` at the same time and place the structure into `DemuxFilterMediaEventExtraMetaData`.",
      "parentUuid": "c9aa42c7_07daae54",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 96,
